          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.2+LEV.16.3+LEV.16.4+LEV.16.5+LEV.16.6+LEV.16.7+LEV.16.8+LEV.16.9+LEV.16.10+LEV.16.11+LEV.16.12+LEV.16.13+LEV.16.14+LEV.16.15+LEV.16.16+LEV.16.17+LEV.16.18+LEV.16.19+LEV.16.20+LEV.16.21+LEV.16.22+LEV.16.23+LEV.16.24+LEV.16.25+LEV.16.26+LEV.16.27+LEV.16.28+LEV.16.29+LEV.16.30+LEV.16.31+LEV.16.32+LEV.16.33+LEV.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abhar 16:2-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono umunchaama umuhikërë bheene nëwe agösoha guitunteera rëëra rë kabhërë; nawe ngökora arë ke hayö harë rimui kömooka. Nawe nkunyoora arë aimukiri amaanyinga gano araruusi mbere yë Ënooköë gikugira yaae umuene na gano araruusi kuibhaga ria amasaria gano abhantö bhaakorrë gökonga kömanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Köhayö Nkoro Nhoreeru nkuigia arë bhörabhu iga nkaaga iritunteera rëëra re këbhara rëkëëho, ënchëra ya gösoha ahasë ahahoreeru bhökong'u tëraigöröa hai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eng'ana ëno ni igituubhaniö gi ichinkaaga cha bhoono. Nko kögamba iga, ësataaka na ibhimuenso bhino bhikuruusibhua tibhigakora abhasengeri bhabhe abhahëkëëranu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gayö gonsui ni ibhiakörea gaitungërë, ibhintö bhia kunyua hamui na öbhörengerria hagarëhagarë bhö guisaabhuura. Gonsui gayö na amaragirriö ga gösaabhuura ömöbhërë këbhara na ngaana ichinguru kuhika ënkaaga ëno Ënooköë arëkora amang'ana bhöhëa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
